# Harness notes — {{project_name}}

Append an entry whenever the harness itself misbehaves (a worker loops, a permission is wrong, a criterion was bad,
a question was missing). `/harvest` moves the useful ones into the template.

Format:

```
## YYYY-MM-DD · short title
- What happened:
- Cause:
- Remedy used:
- Applies to: core | stack:<name> | project
- Status: new            (later: harvested <template-commit>)
```

